"evidence":["Plan: 'the code that invokes verify_completion and inspects its verdict (gate dispatch / CompletionAgentStep caller side)'","close_precheck.py:638 `result = llm.verify_completion(ticket_id, ...)` then :680-700 inspects result and raises on FAIL","gate_dispatch.py:697 constructs CompletionAgentStep INSIDE the verify_completion call chain — it produces, not inspects, the verdict","All CLI/MCP/library closes route through transition.py -> transition_close.close_ticket -> _completion_precheck (transition_close.py:454)"],"finding":"The plan's primary named seam for the resumption loop — 'gate dispatch / CompletionAgentStep caller side' — mislabels the code layer: gate_dispatch.produce_completion_verdict and CompletionAgentStep are the verdict PRODUCERS invoked INSIDE verify_completion (completion.py:120 -> gate_dispatch.py:697 CompletionAgentStep), not the caller that invokes verify_completion and inspects its returned FAIL verdict. On the close path that caller is transition_close._completion_precheck (transition_close.py:454) delegating to close_precheck._completion_precheck (close_precheck.py:497), which invokes verify_completion at close_precheck.py:638 and inspects the verdict at :680-700.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f70272407ddd26f93","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Mechanism step 1","norm_id":"nf48b7d42b236b389","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor takes the primary parenthetical literally and tries to add the resumption loop inside gate_dispatch/CompletionAgentStep, which produce a single verdict and have no notion of a whole-verifier re-run"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Replace '(gate dispatch / CompletionAgentStep caller side)' with '(transition_close._completion_precheck -> close_precheck._completion_precheck, close_precheck.py:638, which invokes verify_completion and inspects its FAIL verdict at :680-700)'.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verificati